window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I fought against fate, and I won. I made a deal with the devil to keep her.</p> <p>It was supposed to be over. We were meant to be happy.</p> <p>Too bad my enemies had other plans.</p> <p><b>Note</b>: This is the conclusion of Peter &amp; Sara’s story. It is strongly recommended that you read Twist Me and Capture Me trilogies before embarking on this audiobook, as there will be major spoilers for those series.</p>"; 
